  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:320px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Assimilation Immunity</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/30/Absorption_Immunity_by_Android_16.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20220227190050\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Absorption Immunity by Android 16\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/30/Absorption_Immunity_by_Android_16.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20220227190050\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/30/Absorption_Immunity_by_Android_16.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20220227190050 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/30/Absorption_Immunity_by_Android_16.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20220227190050 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Absorption Immunity by Android 16\" width=\"270\" height=\"225\" data-image-key=\"Absorption_Immunity_by_Android_16.jpeg\" data-image-name=\"Absorption Immunity by Android 16.jpeg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Due to his fully mechanical body, Android 16 (Dragon Ball Z) is immune to Cell's <a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Absorption\" title=\"Biological Absorption\">Biological Absorption</a>.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Be immune to absorption powers.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Oh, an admirable attempt by the red-headed stepchild! But don't feel too disappointed. For now, you shall be apart of me! (attempts to absorb but fails) ...Of me! (attempts again) Ah... OF ME!!! (attempts one more time) GAH! Gah, what are you made of, pure metal!?\"<br />\"Affirmative. I am <b>Android</b> 16.\"<br />\"Oh... Errors have been made.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Cell and Android 16 (Dragon Ball Abridged)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>be immune to absorption</b>. Sub-Power of <a href=\"/wiki/Anti-Storage\" title=\"Anti-Storage\">Anti-Storage</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Immunity\">Power Immunity</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Selective_Invulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Selective Invulnerability\">Selective Invulnerability</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Know_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Know Objects</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Immunity%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absorbing/Absorption Durability/Cancellation/Immunity/Imperviousness/Invulnerability/Insulation/Nullification/Proof/Protection/Tolerance</li>\n<li>Absorbing/Absorption-Immunity/Proof/Proofness</li>\n<li>Unabsorbable/Unabsorbability</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Immunity%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user is immune to all attempts at being absorbed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Immunity%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Immunity to <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Absorption\" title=\"Category:Absorption\">absorption powers</a> that attempt to absorb the user.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Immunity%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Anti_Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anti Storage\">Anti Storage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Powers\" title=\"Defense Powers\">Defense Powers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption_Immunity\" title=\"Power Absorption Immunity\">Power Absorption Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Immunity\">Power Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Power_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meta Power Immunity\">Meta Power Immunity</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Immunity%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Omni-Absorption\">Omni-Absorption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Almighty_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Almighty Absorbing Replication\">Almighty Absorbing Replication</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Immunity_Bypassing\" title=\"Immunity Bypassing\">Immunity Bypassing</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Immunity_Negation\" title=\"Immunity Negation\">Immunity Negation</a>.</li>\n<li>Does not prevent absorption powers that don't directly affect the user.\n<ul><li>Example: If a user of <a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Absorption\" title=\"Electricity Absorption\">Electricity Absorption</a> tried to absorb a user of <a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Mimicry\" title=\"Electricity Mimicry\">Electricity Mimicry</a>, this would only prevent absorption of the electricity that counts as part of their body.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Immunity%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Android 16 (<i>Dragon Ball Z</i>)</li>\n<li>Ectonurites (<i>Ben 10 series</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonschef.fandom.com/wiki/Javier_Asrahan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:the-greatest-estate-developer:Javier Asrahan\">Javier Asrahan</a> (<i>The Greatest Estate Developer</i>)</li>\n<li>Elvis Riboldi (<i>I Elvis Riboldi</i>); via <a href=\"/wiki/Alien_Mind\" title=\"Alien Mind\">Alien Mind</a> Limited to <a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Absorption\" title=\"Knowledge Absorption\">Knowledge Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://imagecomics.fandom.com/wiki/Brit\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:imagecomics:Brit\">Brit</a> (<i>Image Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://imagecomics.fandom.com/wiki/Britney\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:imagecomics:Britney\">Britney</a> (<i>Image Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Tricky (<i>Madness Combat</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-682\">SCP-682 - Hard-To-Destroy Reptile</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>Neo (<i>The Matrix</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tensura.fandom.com/wiki/Rimuru_Tempest\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:tensura:Rimuru Tempest\">Rimuru Tempest</a> (<i>Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken/That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Know_Objects\">Know Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Immunity%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Britney's Indestructibility Serum (<i>Image Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Megas (<i>Megas XLR</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260731164327\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 126/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 530/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 528/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   19.251      1 -total\n 90.23%   17.371      1 Template:Infobox\n  9.07%    1.747      1 Template:Quote\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:336127-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGallerie